OL,3,GNEWSAMinister announces expert
OL,4,Acommittee to review health services
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new independent expert advisory
OL,7,Fcommittee is to review how services
OL,8,Fwill be delivered across hospitals in
OL,9,FNorthern Ireland.
OL,11,FHealth minister Robbie Butler said the
OL,12,FReconfiguration Committee will provide
OL,13,Fhim with advice on major or
OL,14,Fcontroversial proposals for permanent
OL,15,Fchanges to health and social care
OL,16,Fservices.
OL,18,FIt follows a major political and public
OL,19,Frow around the future of Emergency
OL,20,FGeneral Surgery at Causeway Hospital
OL,21,Fwhich triggered the resignation of Mike
OL,22,FNesbitt.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
